# The tree is authored with LF. A Windows checkout rewrote the working copy to
# CRLF, which turned every diff into whole-file churn. Pin LF in the repository
# and let git normalize on checkout, so the history stays readable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Batch files must keep CRLF: cmd.exe mishandles LF-only labels and goto.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
